WEBVTT

00:00:58.697 --> 00:01:01.430
A hopeful sign about the future, perhaps?

00:01:01.863 --> 00:01:05.030
We planted foxglove and it thrived.

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:07.397
And then we went a little crazy.

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:10.463
We planted tomatoes, carrots, beans, corn,

00:01:10.497 --> 00:01:12.797
lettuce and cucumbers, strawberries,

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:14.730
blueberries and limes.

00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:18.263
It's such a strange time in the world.

00:01:18.863 --> 00:01:22.630
There is so much beauty
amidst so much fear.

00:01:22.997 --> 00:01:25.597
It's so hard to know what to do.

00:01:26.697 --> 00:01:27.930
In the meantime,

00:01:27.963 --> 00:01:30.463
we watch and wait